cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Italian Renewable Capacity Explorer"
abstract: >-
  Local-first explorer for the renewable capacity installed in Italy, by region, province
  and source: solar, wind, hydro, bioenergy and geothermal. Data come from the Terna
  developer API and are cached locally; the server is Bun/TypeScript and the interface a
  React dashboard.
authors:
  - family-names: "D'Acunzio"
    given-names: "Tommaso"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-9081-1852"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tomdacu/italian-renewable-capacity-explorer"
keywords:
  - renewable energy
  - open data
  - Italy
  - data visualization
  - TypeScript
type: software
